---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Mood for Life Framework">
  <section class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Framework</p>
    <h1>The Mood for Life framework</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Mood is shaped by systems of attention, biology, habit, relationship, meaning, and disciplined practice.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid-3">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Mind</h2>
      <p>Cognition, affect, attention, diagnostic self-awareness, and emotional regulation.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Body</h2>
      <p>Exercise, nutrition, inflammation, sleep, metabolic health, aging, and physical resilience.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Spirit</h2>
      <p>Meaning, moral orientation, spiritual attention, contemplative depth, and connection.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="callout">
    <strong>Future visual:</strong> this page would benefit from a simple diagram showing Mood for Life as a regulating system connecting mind, body, spirit, relationship, and disciplined practice.
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
